# Design source material, local-only. The Stitch export is a vendor
# download and the screenshots are working references; neither is part
# of the product and the repo is public.
*.zip
Screenshot*.png
# Review drafts written before they are posted. Local-only: the repo is
# public, and an unposted review comment is working material, not a
# published artefact.
docs/pending-reviews/

# The MASEL project report is a coursework deliverable, not product
# documentation. Local-only.
docs/*.docx
docs/*.docx.bak

# --- Browser-driving output (kept locally, never published) ---
# The Playwright MCP server writes page snapshots, console logs and
# screenshots here while a screen is being checked against the running
# app. Kept in the project root on purpose, so a later session can
# compare today's capture with a new one instead of re-deriving it. The
# contents are a moment in time, not a product artefact, and a snapshot
# of a signed-in demo screen can carry a session token in a console
# line - which this repo is public, so it must not travel.
.playwright-mcp/
# Screenshots taken with an explicit filename land in the project root
# rather than in that directory, so the rule above does not reach them.
# Same material and the same reason: these are captures of a signed-in
# demo society, and `Screenshot*.png` above only matches the browser's
# own default naming.
/*.png
